window.__T__=[{"i":6320,"text":"Ultra-realistic tiny planet (360°) portrait of a {argument name=\"subject\" default=\"beautiful young woman\"} standing joyfully at the center of a {argument name=\"setting\" default=\"rooftop terrace at night\"}, arms outstretched, wearing a {argument name=\"clothing\" default=\"light blue floral summer dress, a beige knitted cardigan, and brown ankle boots\"}. She has long wavy chestnut-brown hair with soft curtain bangs, fair glowing skin, delicate facial features, natural makeup, and warm brown eyes matching the reference face. The rooftop is surrounded by metal railings, potted plants, and warm string lights. A breathtaking illuminated city skyline wraps around the circular tiny planet beneath a deep star-filled sky with the Milky Way visible. Captured with an ultra-wide fisheye lens creating a perfect tiny-planet effect, cinematic night lighting, HDR, ultra-detailed, photorealistic, 8K, sharp focus, vibrant city lights, realistic textures, dreamy atmosphere, professional photography.","imgs":["https://cms-assets.youmind.com/media/1786090940954_f3go7v_HPFvll9akAAMItm.jpg"]},{"i":6321,"text":"Ultra-realistic cinematic portrait of a handsome man with neatly styled dark hair, a well-groomed beard, and {argument name=\"eyewear\" default=\"black rectangular eyeglasses\"}, looking directly into the camera with a calm, confident expression. He wears a {argument name=\"shirt style\" default=\"vibrant floral-patterned button-up shirt\"}. Dramatic {argument name=\"lighting\" default=\"golden-hour\"} lighting shines through crystal prisms, casting vivid rainbow refractions across his face, neck, and clothing. Luxurious warm bokeh background filled with sparkling crystal chandeliers and hanging prisms. Shallow depth of field, razor-sharp facial details, natural skin texture, high contrast, soft cinematic glow, premium fashion editorial photography, 85mm lens, f/1.4, HDR, ultra-detailed, photorealistic, 8K, masterpiece.","imgs":["https://cms-assets.youmind.com/media/1786090891784_7x6ons_HPFst3abcAAb3go.jpg"]},{"i":6322,"text":"Create an ultra-realistic forced-perspective optical illusion portrait in a clean minimalist studio with a seamless warm light-gray background. Show {argument name=\"main character\" default=\"a beautiful young woman with long dark brown hair\"} walking confidently toward the right, looking slightly to her left with a calm expression, holding {argument name=\"drink\" default=\"a transparent plastic cup of iced coffee\"} in one hand. She wears {argument name=\"outerwear\" default=\"an oversized light gray bomber jacket layered over a dark charcoal hoodie\"}, very baggy light-wash denim cargo jeans, and gray-and-white sneakers. Use forced perspective so the denim fabric of one pant leg stretches dramatically backward, as if being pulled. Behind her, include exactly 1 tiny chibi-style mini version of the same woman, angry and determined, gripping the stretched pant leg with both hands and leaning back while pulling; the chibi has long brown hair, an exaggerated frowning face, a small gray jacket, dark hoodie, baggy jeans, and sneakers. Add exactly 7 simple black hand-drawn manga doodle accents around the figures: 2 sparkle clusters near the main woman, 1 sweat/concern mark near her head, 2 puffs of steam near the chibi, 1 set of pull-motion lines near the stretched pants, and 1 curved foot-motion mark near the front shoe. The image should blend photorealistic fashion photography for the main woman with a polished cartoon chibi character, sharp full-body composition, soft studio lighting, subtle floor shadow, editorial realism, no text, no watermark, vertical 2:3 aspect ratio.","imgs":["https://cms-assets.youmind.com/media/1786090952864_iikfzz_HPFo5hsaAAAdue8.jpg"]},{"i":6323,"text":"Subject: {argument name=\"subject\" default=\"Yellow Flower Pressed to Lips\"}\n\nMain Figure:\nA knee-up portrait of a young woman in an {argument name=\"outfit\" default=\"off-white delicate lace dress and wrap\"} sitting in a field of yellow flowers glowing in the sunset. The person is placed prominently in the center-bottom, showcasing the flower in front of her face, the lace falling from her shoulders, surrounding yellow blooms, and golden backlighting.\n\nPerson/Expression:\nA small oval face turned slightly left, chin tucked, large light-brown eyes looking into the distance. Quiet expression with closed pale pink lips behind the petals. Radiant skin with soft pink cheeks. Ash-brown bobbed hair with thin bangs and curls rimmed in golden light.\n\nClothing/Pose:\n{argument name=\"outfit\" default=\"Off-white long dress with thin straps\"}. Deep V-neck with white floral embroidery, lace, and a bow. Over it, a matching translucent lace gown worn off-the-shoulder, spreading over the knees. A large fabric scrunchie on the left wrist and gold rings. Sitting in the field, holding a single yellow flower to the center of her lips with her left hand.\n\nBackground/Light:\nDensely packed thin green stalks and small orange-yellow flowers. White bright evening sky above, with golden bokeh in the top right. Soft direct light from the low sunset in the rear-right rims the hair, shoulders, and lace in strong gold, with warm diffused light on the face.\n\nComposition/Camera:\n3:4 aspect ratio. Horizontal eye-level shot slightly above chest height. Subject takes up three-quarters of the height. Focus on eyes, lips, and the held flower; shallow depth of field with soft bokeh for the field.\n\nTexture/Style:\nHigh-definition photorealistic photo with tones of gold, orange-yellow, cream, and soft green. Delicate rendering of skin texture, fine lace, petals, and sunlight edges.\n\nNegative:\nDo not change the placement of the yellow flower at the lips; do not omit the embroidered dress or off-the-shoulder gown.","imgs":["https://cms-assets.youmind.com/media/1786090921188_0lzwa0_HOt3xgKaIAArBae.jpg"]},{"i":6324,"text":"A cozy outdoor lifestyle portrait of a cute young woman sitting on a wooden camping chair during a sunny afternoon, casually tying her {argument name=\"hair style\" default=\"long black hair\"} into a ponytail with a {argument name=\"hair accessory\" default=\"lavender scrunchie\"}. She wears an oversized {argument name=\"sweatshirt color\" default=\"pastel mint-green\"} sweatshirt, loose white jogger sweatpants, and chunky white sneakers, creating a relaxed Korean casual fashion look. Soft fair skin, natural makeup with rosy cheeks, subtle pink lips, delicate facial features, looking downward with a gentle smile. A white tour bus, trees, and clear blue sky in the background create a peaceful travel atmosphere. An iced coffee sits beside the chair, adding to the cozy picnic vibe. Warm golden sunlight, natural outdoor lighting, cinematic composition, shallow depth of field, soft bokeh, ultra-realistic skin texture, editorial lifestyle photography, 50mm lens, f/1.8, HDR, 8K, photorealistic, premium fashion campaign, clean aesthetic, tranquil and youthful mood.","imgs":["https://cms-assets.youmind.com/media/1786090893406_411dp4_HPFpqoFbAAAbgQu.jpg"]},{"i":6325,"text":"Facial Identity: Use the attached facial identity as the sole facial reference. The four photos must consistently match the same facial features, skin tone, age, and overall identity. Body: An adult female in her {argument name=\"age\" default=\"early 20s\"}. Use the attached body reference as the sole body proportion reference, maintaining realistic anatomy, natural curves, and skin texture. Theme: Four scenes of Tang Dynasty entertainment: Qujiang flower competition, Chang'an tavern, post-dance at a music studio, and after a polo match. Subject: Generate four independent vertical 2:3 color realistic photos, no collages. All four must maintain the same character, but change hairstyles, costumes, expressions, and photographic language consistent with the aesthetics of the {argument name=\"era\" default=\"Sheng Tang (High Tang)\"}. First shot 'Victory Revealed in the Flower Gaps': Close-up shot through peonies and colorful curtains. She wears a semi-turned Tang bun, asymmetrical hairpins, and a modern aesthetic Tang-style Ruqun in apricot white, stone green, and peony red. She turns toward a friend at the sound, eyebrows slightly raised, a smile just appearing. Use 100-135mm telephoto observation, foreground obstruction, and low-contrast color negative texture. Second shot 'Seventh Round at the Chang'an Tavern': The character sits by a low table in a Hu tavern, laughing after putting down a gilded cup. Her hair is in a Wu Man bun, wearing peacock blue brocade, a vermilion short-sleeved top, and a deep crimson skirt. Use a 35mm documentary perspective, with table edges, jars, and guest backs naturally entering the foreground. Warm light covers the features. Third shot 'Colorful Breath After the Dance': After the final dance, the character stops by a silk curtain to catch her breath. High Tang dance bun with a loose strand. Dark red and peacock green dance clothes with opaque layers. She looks out the curtain, lips parted, fatigue, satisfaction, and surprise coexisting. 50mm backstage close-up, soft mist color negative. Fourth shot 'Turning Back After the Polo Line': A female rider walks toward the rest area after dismounting, turning back mid-stride at a call. Double-spiral riding bun, wearing dark red inner layer, stone blue narrow-sleeved robe, and leather boots. One hand grips the polo mallet coming from the bottom edge. 135mm long focal length, 1/40s color slow shutter panning. Lighting: Natural wide lighting or hooded indoor lamps. Texture: Real color photography with pores, fuzz, and film grain. Signature: Small handwritten signature '{argument name=\"signature\" default=\"Zhong\"}' in the bottom right. Negative prompt: Collage, multi-shot, identity drift, modern ponytail, cheap costumes, robotic expressions, duplicate background figures, complex gestures, extra limbs, light spots, plastic skin, black and white, modern scenes, garbled text.","imgs":["https://cms-assets.youmind.com/media/1786090916312_xkxn2n_HPFT9K1bkAA88RK.jpg"]},{"i":6326,"text":"Theme:\nBoth legs extended on the grass\n\nSubject:\nA full-body portrait of a young woman wearing {argument name=\"clothing\" default=\"grey sports top and shorts\"} sitting on a yoga mat in a {argument name=\"location\" default=\"sunny park\"}, with her legs spread high and her hands holding her toes. The figure is placed large from the center to the bottom, showing one leg extending straight toward the front center, one leg opening diagonally to the left, both arms, grass, and trees.\n\nPerson/Expression:\nA small oval face turned to the left of the screen, chin raised slightly, looking into the far distance at the top left with dark brown eyes. Thin dark eyebrows, a small straight nose, and a gentle smile with pale rose lips closed. Fair skin with pale pink cheeks. Long dark brown hair tied in a high ponytail near the crown, with thin bangs and wavy strands around the face, and long ends hanging down her back on the right.\n\nClothing/Pose:\nLight blue-grey sports top and shorts of the same color. The top has thin shoulder straps, a shallow V-neck, a short length down to the under-bust, and fine vertical ribs. The shorts have a wide waist and loose hems. White ankle-length socks. A translucent light green bangle on the right wrist, and a thin silver bracelet on the left wrist. Sitting down on a grey mat, raising both legs straight to the knees in a large V-shape. The right leg is extended almost vertically toward the center foreground, with the right hand holding those toes. The left leg is opened diagonally to the top left, with the left arm extended holding the left toes.\n\nBackground/Light:\nA grey rectangular yoga mat and short green grass in the foreground. The midground is a bright grassy field, with a large tree with dense green leaves from the right to the top, and small trees and distant figures in the back left. The top left is a bright white sky. Soft morning direct light from the top left illuminates the face, shoulders, and both legs, casting faint but clear shadows on the right side of the body and mat. Fine dappled sunlight through the tree leaves.\n\nComposition/Camera:\n5:7 aspect ratio. The camera is at a horizontal eye-level slightly lower than the seated subject's waist, a full-body shot capturing from both toes to the bottom edge of the mat. The figure is captured large, occupying almost the entire screen height, with the face in the upper right, the central leg as a thick vertical line from the bottom edge to near the top edge, and the other leg and left arm spreading to the top left. The central leg is shown large as a strong foreground element, with the waist and mat in the bottom third. Sharp focus on the face and body, with the distance lightly blurred.\n\nTexture/Style:\nA high-definition photorealistic photo based on young grass green, light blue-grey, white, and natural skin tones. Realistically depicts skin texture, fine ribs in the sports fabric, white socks, blades of grass, fine unevenness of the mat, and morning dappled sunlight.\n\nNegative:\nDo not change the {argument name=\"pose\" default=\"yoga\"} posture with legs spread high; do not break the contact between hands and toes.","imgs":["https://cms-assets.youmind.com/media/1786090929012_nb51ri_HOt3RdoaIAAlyBr.jpg"]},{"i":6327,"text":"Goal: Create a 16:9 cinematic historical PowerPoint cover slide about the {argument name=\"historical event\" default=\"Wenxi Fire in Changsha, 1938\"}, using a heavy archival collage aesthetic that feels solemn, painful, and reflective.\n\nCanvas: Wide presentation slide, 1200×675 or 16:9. Use an aged beige paper background with faint grid lines, scratches, stains, fold marks, dust, and worn print texture. The overall palette is sepia, charcoal black, brick red, smoky gray, and deep teal.\n\nLayout: Design one dense poster-like slide with exactly 5 main visual zones: 1) a narrow vertical brick-red strip on the far left with faint city imagery and vertical Chinese text, 2) a huge central title occupying the left and middle of the slide, 3) a burning ruined city panorama across the lower half and right center, 4) a torn-paper map collage in the upper-right corner, and 5) a dark teal torn-paper information block in the lower-right corner.\n\nText content: At the top-left, set small bilingual/location text: “长沙  CHANGSHA”, then “1938”, then “WENXI FIRE”, separated by thin horizontal rules. The main title must be enormous Chinese typography reading “文夕大火”, with “文夕” in distressed black and “大火” in distressed dark red. Under the title, place a beige label strip reading “1938年长沙的伤害、余痛与重生”. Below it, add a smaller subtitle: “一场由战时决策失控引发的城市灾难”. Under that, add a small black rectangular tag reading “课件视觉图组”. In the upper-right, add a bold “1938” with a small red label “WENXI FIRE”, plus a vertical framed Chinese stamp-like label reading “长沙文夕大火”. In the lower-right, add a large page indicator “01 / 10”. Include one short vertical handwritten-style Chinese note over the teal panel, subtle and atmospheric.\n\nSubject details: The city scene should show old Changsha streets in ruins, dark silhouettes of people walking, damaged traditional and early modern buildings, telephone poles, rubble piles, and a large building burning with orange flames and thick black smoke rising into the sky. Add torn collage edges where the city photo meets the paper background. Include exactly 1 prominent fire plume, exactly 1 large smoke column, exactly 1 rubble pile in the lower-left foreground, exactly 1 torn map fragment in the upper-right, and exactly 1 teal torn-paper block in the lower-right.\n\nVisual style: Heavy historical aesthetics, archival documentary poster, Chinese modernist editorial design, distressed letterpress typography, old newspaper collage, torn paper, grainy halftone, scratches, muted contrast, somber memorial mood. Use bold geometric Chinese title characters with rough ink erosion and printed wear. Keep the composition dramatic but readable.\n\nConstraints: Do not make it look modern, glossy, or clean. Avoid extra decorative icons, people portraits, watermarks, or random English filler text. Preserve the exact slide/page feeling and the solemn historical tone.","imgs":["https://cms-assets.youmind.com/media/1785487805405_8n9kye_HOZ5cqUbYAAYKVp.jpg"]},{"i":6328,"text":"A 3x3 photo grid presented as a single image on a {argument name=\"background color\" default=\"dark grey\"} background. Each of the nine grid cells contains a different portrait of the same subject from the uploaded image, maintaining the perfect character consistency, outfit and pose across all panels. Below each individual portrait, a clean sans-serif text label with a number and name is clearly displayed.\nThe grid layout and lighting setups are:\n- Top row, left to right:\nLoop Lighting (Flattering 3/4 light with a small loop of shadow from the nose onto the cheek)\nHardlight Frontal Flash (direct front facing, harsh flashlight with deep frontal shadows)\nSplit Lighting (dramatic light on only one side of the face, leaving the other side completely dark)\n- Middle row, left to right:\nButterfly Lighting  (classic symmetrical light from the front, slightly high, with a small shadow under the nose)\nGobo Pattern (Venetian Blind)' (light projected through Venetian blinds, creating linear shadows across the face and clothes, the shadow can also be scene on the background)\nUnder-Lighting (Uplight)' (light coming from below, creating reverse shadows and a moody look)\n- Bottom row, left to right:\nGolden Hour / Warm Light' (bathed in soft, golden, warm light from a side angle)\nDramatic Spotlight  (hard, narrow circular beam of light, with a deep chiascuro effect and crushed blacks)\nNeutral Kelvin Rim Light' (intense backlighting with no front fill, creating a distinct glowing outline around the hair and shoulders, leaving the face in darkness, against a black background).\nThe perspective and features remain identical in all panels, with only the specified lighting changing to match the label.","imgs":["https://cms-assets.youmind.com/media/1785401361850_pqw18t_HOZPrBfXsAAQ8E3.jpg"]},{"i":6329,"text":"Goal: Create a cinematic 16:9 PowerPoint cover slide for a children’s AI art course, blending premium Chinese aesthetics, futuristic AI education, and warm imaginative storytelling.\n\nCanvas: Wide presentation slide, 1366×768 or 16:9 ratio. Dark black-to-burgundy background with a strong vertical glowing portal slightly right of center. Use a luxury black, deep red, ivory, and gold palette with soft haze, dust particles, and luminous light trails.\n\nLayout: Left side is the typography area; right side is the fantasy visual scene. Place a large two-line Chinese title on the left: first line “小孩AI绘图”, second line “培训版”, with elegant Song/Ming-style serif Chinese typography, ivory on top and warm gold accents below. Under the title, add one subtitle line: “让孩子用AI打开想象力 · 创造力 · 未来视觉表达”. Below that, add a small caption: “儿童AI创意绘画课程介绍”. In the top-left corner, include a tiny vertical four-line motto reading “想象力 / 表达力 / 未来力 / 创造力” with a small red seal-like square beneath it.\n\nSubject details: On the right, show one small child silhouette standing at the base of the glowing portal, facing away from the viewer and reaching one hand toward floating visual panels. The child should look about 5–7 years old, short, with a rounded head silhouette and simple clothing, rendered as a warm backlit figure. Around the child, include exactly 5 floating art panels: 2 small dark red abstract landscape panels near the upper right, 2 pale Chinese ink landscape panels stacked near the middle-right, and 1 small translucent rectangular panel near the portal. Add exactly 4 main geometric accents: 1 large translucent red moon/circle behind the portal, 1 thin outlined circle in the upper right, 1 small outlined square near it, and 1 beige sphere near the lower left. Add a red ribbon-like orbit around the child and golden wave particles sweeping from lower left toward the portal.\n\nVisual style: High-end course-presentation cover, cinematic lighting, subtle Chinese ink landscape silhouettes along the bottom left, faint bamboo silhouette on the far right, layered transparent rectangles, thin technical lines, warm golden vertical beam, glossy floor reflection, dramatic contrast, refined editorial composition, premium education brand aesthetic.\n\nCustomizable text: Main title should read {argument name=\"main title\" default=\"小孩AI绘图\\n培训版\"}. Subtitle should read {argument name=\"subtitle\" default=\"让孩子用AI打开想象力 · 创造力 · 未来视觉表达\"}. Small course label should read {argument name=\"course label\" default=\"儿童AI创意绘画课程介绍\"}. Motto should read {argument name=\"vertical motto\" default=\"想象力\\n表达力\\n未来力\\n创造力\"}. Overall theme should remain {argument name=\"course theme\" default=\"children’s AI creative drawing course\"}.\n\nConstraints: Keep the composition uncluttered and presentation-ready. Do not add extra people, extra title text, logos, watermarks, or UI elements. Preserve the luxurious black-red-gold palette and the exact counts of 1 child, 5 floating art panels, and 4 main geometric accents.","imgs":["https://cms-assets.youmind.com/media/1785401443214_vbbdd5_HOULjsDbYAAARnb.jpg"]},{"i":6330,"text":"Generate a high-end pop idol typography cover poster.\n\nTheme: {argument name=\"theme\" default=\"music cover / idol visual / pop editorial / campaign concept\"}\nDirection: {argument name=\"style direction\" default=\"Dynamic red typography cover / Red-background focused portrait cover / Dynamic idol stage poster / Headphone pop editorial cover\"}\nMain Title: {argument name=\"main title\" default=\"[Fill in main title]\"}\nSubtitle: [Fill in short subtitle]\nEdition Small Text: [Fill in issue number / edition / minor info]\nSubject: [Adult young female idol / Adult young male idol / Pop artist / Performer from different countries]\nCountry Setting: [China / Korea / Japan / Thailand / France / USA / Brazil / Argentina / UK, etc.]\nAtmosphere: [bold / stylish / emotional / kinetic / youthful / graphic / editorial]\nColor System: [Red / White / Black / Crimson / Soft White]\n\nThe overall effect should resemble a high-end pop music visual cover or a fashion magazine poster.\n\nUse oversized typography as part of the visual structure, not just a simple title.\n\nAllow significant interaction between the subject and the text through: occlusion, interweaving, cropping, perspective, spatial layering, partial blurring, and foreground/background relationships.\n\nLayout should be clean and impactful, retaining only a small amount of auxiliary text.\n\nChoose one of the following four directions:\n\n1. Dynamic Red Typography Cover\nUse a white or off-white background with oversized bold red text. Feature an adult young female or male idol in a dynamic pose, interacting strongly with the text.\n\n2. Red Background Focused Portrait Cover\nUse a rich red background with a close-up or half-body portrait of an idol. Include elegant white serif text with a subtle focus box over the eyes; a dreamy atmosphere with clear eyes.\n\n3. Dynamic Idol Stage Poster\nUse strong performance poses and exaggerated perspective (e.g., legs, boots, or arms closer to the lens). Large text is partially cut by the body, creating a stage visual or concert poster feel.\n\n4. Headphone Pop Editorial Cover\nFeature an idol wearing headphones in a close-up or half-body shot. Incorporate tall vertical text interacting with the subject's silhouette, paired with 1-2 small label text boxes for a stylish, non-crowded look.\n\nAvoid: Cheap template feel, excessive small text, cluttered composition, weak fonts, fake brand logos, deformed limbs, incorrect fingers, plastic skin, or piled-up sticker elements.\n\nRequirements: Bold, clean, modern, and design-oriented. Generate only one high-quality standalone poster.","imgs":["https://cms-assets.youmind.com/media/1783241293786_thr1fm_HMXaeW0aIAAiu_6.jpg"]},{"i":6331,"text":"Create a cinematic 5-panel storyboard featuring a tiny young woman inside a modern refrigerator. She has {argument name=\"hair color\" default=\"long, wavy dark brown hair\"}, fair skin, a bright cheerful smile, and wears a {argument name=\"top\" default=\"white knitted long-sleeve crop sweater\"} with {argument name=\"bottom\" default=\"white drawstring shorts\"}. She is barefoot throughout the scene.\n\nPanel 1: The tiny woman stands happily on the refrigerator door shelf beside a row of large white eggs. The refrigerator is fully stocked with colorful soda cans, fruit juice cartons, fresh fruits, vegetables, a delicious chocolate cake, and sparkling ice cubes. Bright, clean LED lighting creates a fresh premium atmosphere.\n\nPanel 2: She accidentally steps onto a giant egg, causing it to crack open. Rich golden egg yolk spills dramatically across the transparent glass shelf. She raises both arms in surprise while skillfully keeping her balance.\n\nPanel 3: She carefully leaps across stacked juice cartons, avoiding the flowing egg yolk. Capture a dynamic action pose with realistic motion blur, cinematic movement, and a strong sense of energy.\n\nPanel 4: She lands safely inside the refrigerator, smiling joyfully with both hands raised in celebration. The modern refrigerator interior is spotless, illuminated with cool white LED lighting and surrounded by neatly arranged food items.\n\nPanel 5: She crouches happily on the bottom shelf, laughing after completing the challenge. The refrigerator walls are clean and minimal, creating a simple background that keeps the focus on the tiny character.\n\nUltra-realistic, photorealistic, cinematic storytelling, miniature human illusion, premium commercial-quality photography, highly detailed refrigerator interior, realistic food textures, HDR, soft cool LED lighting, natural skin tones, 8K resolution, sharp focus, dynamic composition, shallow depth of field, 35mm lens, ultra-detailed realism.","imgs":["https://cms-assets.youmind.com/media/1786090932807_1a49z9_HPF099ua0AADC47.jpg"]},{"i":6332,"text":"Create an ultra-realistic whimsical miniature fantasy scene: a large cracked white eggshell standing upright in a delicate vintage ceramic egg cup with floral patterns, placed on a rustic wooden kitchen table surrounded by artisan bread loaves. Through the jagged opening in the eggshell, reveal a tiny cozy breakfast room built inside the egg. Inside, show one miniature person, a young adult woman with {argument name=\"hair color and style\" default=\"short dark curly hair\"}, wearing {argument name=\"outfit\" default=\"pink striped pajamas\"}, seated at a small wooden table and yawning with one hand near her mouth. The room should include exactly 14 visible interior props: a wooden window with warm golden morning light, three small potted plants on the windowsill, a basket of sliced bread, a cup and saucer, a plate with toast, a second plate with toast, a teacup with tea, a spoon, a tiny jam dish, a wall shelf, three framed wall pictures, and a small hanging decoration. Use shallow depth of field, macro photography realism, warm natural sunlight, soft shadows, intricate eggshell cracks, tactile ceramic texture, cozy cottagecore details, and cinematic composition. Keep the background softly blurred with two wooden chairs and four visible bread loaves around the egg. No text, no watermark, no surreal extra limbs, no distorted face.","imgs":["https://cms-assets.youmind.com/media/1786090951813_gt6yje_HPA7XaqakAE-tLX.jpg"]},{"i":6333,"text":"Goal: Create a premium cinematic coffee commercial storyboard as a single static image, showing the full journey from coffee seed to finished latte. Use a dark minimalist studio look with pure black backgrounds, dramatic low-key lighting, shallow depth of field, macro photography realism, rich brown coffee tones, glossy highlights, and elegant white captions.\n\nCanvas: 16:9 widescreen storyboard sheet, divided into exactly 10 vertical panels arranged in a 2-row by 5-column grid. Use thin dark gray dividers between panels. Each panel should feel like a high-end commercial still frame, with black negative space and a subject lit by a narrow soft spotlight.\n\nLayout: Top row contains panels 1–5 with centered white caption text near the lower third but no visible numbers. Bottom row contains panels 6–10 with small white timing labels at the top left of each panel and centered white caption text near the bottom. Keep all typography clean, modern, sans-serif, white, and unobtrusive.\n\nStoryboard panels, exactly 10:\n1. A roasted-looking coffee seed partly embedded in dark soil, lit from the side, caption: “The coffee seed meets the soil.”\n2. A coffee seed cracking open with a curved green sprout emerging upward from dark soil, caption: “The first sprout breaks through.”\n3. A young coffee seedling with two fresh green leaves and thin pale roots visible in the soil, caption: “New life grows in the darkness.”\n4. A taller green coffee sprout flanked by two split brown seed halves, caption: “The seed transforms, shaped by nature.”\n5. A glossy green coffee cherry hanging from a thin branch in darkness, with a small droplet beneath it, caption: “The cherry ripens in silence.”\n6. Bottom-left panel with top-left label “6   5.0 - 6.0s”; show a ripe red coffee cherry split open to reveal a pale bean inside, growing from dark soil, caption: “The bean is born, rich and whole.”\n7. Top-left label “7   6.0 - 7.0s”; show a single roasted coffee bean floating or isolated against black, very close macro detail, caption: “From nature’s work to harvest.”\n8. Top-left label “8   7.0 - 8.0s”; show finely ground coffee falling from a grinder into a portafilter held by a hand, caption: “Ground to perfection.”\n9. Top-left label “9   8.0 - 9.0s”; show espresso extraction with two thin streams pouring from a portafilter into a dark cup below, caption: “Extracted with precision.”\n10. Top-left label “10   9.0 - 10.0s”; show a barista hand pouring steamed milk from a metal pitcher into a cup of espresso, forming clean latte art, caption: “Crafted into a perfect harmony.”\n\nText customization: Use {argument name=\"brand mood\" default=\"premium cinematic coffee commercial\"} styling. The main caption tone should be poetic and minimal. Optionally replace the final caption with {argument name=\"final caption\" default=\"Crafted into a perfect harmony.\"} while preserving the same placement.\n\nVisual constraints: Keep exactly 10 panels, exactly 5 panels per row, and preserve the numbered timing labels only on panels 6 through 10. Do not add logos, watermarks, extra icons, extra panels, decorative borders, or unrelated text. Maintain realistic coffee textures, dark soil particles, deep blacks, warm highlights, and a luxurious commercial atmosphere.","imgs":["https://cms-assets.youmind.com/media/1786090951492_syc0pq_HPAU9GybQAAtJgQ.jpg"]},{"i":6334,"text":"Goal: Create a polished cinematic storyboard sheet for a short animated fantasy scene about {argument name=\"character name\" default=\"a tiny dragon\"} discovering an unexpected magical ability.\n\nCanvas: Wide 16:9 storyboard board, eight panels arranged in a clean 4-by-2 grid. Each panel has a vivid image area on top and a black caption strip beneath it. Use thin black dividers between panels. Overall look: high-end 3D animated family-film style, warm forest lighting, shallow depth of field, expressive character acting, glowing particles, lush flowers, moss, butterflies, and soft golden sunbeams.\n\nMain subject details: The main character is a cute small orange baby dragon with a cream belly, big green eyes, tiny horns, small bat wings, rounded snout, soft scales, and childlike proportions. The story takes place in an enchanted woodland clearing full of flowers, mossy stones, firefly-like sparkles, and friendly animals. The dragon is trying to breathe fire, but instead creates {argument name=\"magical breath effect\" default=\"rainbow flame\"}.\n\nLayout and exact panel count: Use exactly 8 storyboard panels, numbered 1 through 8, with these visible captions and actions:\n\nPanel 1 caption: “1. (0–2s) Establishing Shot” with subcaption “A tiny dragon stands alone, looking determined.” Image: wide establishing shot of the dragon standing on a forest path in a glowing magical clearing, butterflies and flowers around it.\n\nPanel 2 caption: “2. (2–4s) Determination” with subcaption “The dragon puffs its cheeks, takes a huge breath, and spreads its wings.” Image: medium close-up of the dragon squeezing its eyes shut, cheeks inflated, wings open, preparing dramatically.\n\nPanel 3 caption: “3. (4–6s) Failure” with subcaption “It exhales with all its strength… but only a tiny puff of smoke comes out.” Image: close-up of one winking eye and puckered mouth releasing a small gray smoke cloud.\n\nPanel 4 caption: “4. (6–8s) Embarrassment” with subcaption “The dragon feels shy while a bird tilts its head, watching curiously.” Image: the dragon scratches its head sheepishly while a cute blue bird perches on a branch nearby.\n\nPanel 5 caption: “5. (8–10s) The Sneeze” with subcaption “The smoke tickles its nose. It builds up… and prepares for the biggest sneeze ever!” Image: extreme close-up of the dragon’s face, wide eyes, smoky swirl around its nostril, about to sneeze.\n\nPanel 6 caption: “6. (10–12s) Magical Surprise” with subcaption “It sneezes! Instead of fire, a HUGE burst of rainbow flames explodes out!” Image: side view of the dragon sneezing a massive sparkling rainbow blast, bright saturated colors, glittering embers.\n\nPanel 7 caption: “7. (12–14s) Wonder” with subcaption “Animals stare in amazement as the rainbow flames light up the whole forest.” Image: wider shot with the dragon in the center, surrounded by exactly 5 visible woodland animals watching in awe: a rabbit, a squirrel, a deer-like fawn, a hedgehog, and a small bird. Rainbow fire arcs above them through the trees.\n\nPanel 8 caption: “8. (14–15s) Happy Ending” with subcaption “The dragon laughs with joy as a tiny rainbow flame dances above its nose. Everyone celebrates!” Image: joyful close-up of the dragon laughing open-mouthed, eyes sparkling, tiny rainbow flame curling above its nose, cheering forest animals blurred behind.\n\nVisual style: Cinematic 3D animation, cute Pixar-like character appeal, detailed scales and soft skin texture, warm orange-and-gold lighting, magical rainbow glow, volumetric sun rays, bokeh, expressive faces, high production value, family-friendly tone.\n\nText constraints: Keep all captions in English exactly as written. Use clean white sans-serif text centered on each black caption strip. Maintain legibility. Do not add extra panels, logos, watermarks, UI elements, or unrelated text.","imgs":["https://cms-assets.youmind.com/media/1785573901636_xb3x14_HOnk0LAXAAAmnvk.jpg"]},{"i":6335,"text":"Retro 90s anime-style illustration; a low-angle fisheye shot looking up from the DJ deck; a playful girl with a long, high ash-brown ponytail and sharp green eyes flashes a sly smile at the camera; she wears a white cropped hoodie (hood down, midriff exposed) and dynamically stretches one arm across the glowing turntable setup (featuring red slipmats); the background shows a nighttime festival midway under a canopy of golden star garlands, with massive, colorful fireworks blooming in magenta, green, and orange, plus distant city lights and a bokeh Ferris wheel; bold flat color blocks in deep red, navy blue, teal, and hot pink; intense red rim lighting accentuating her face and white hoodie; thick, clean linework; screen-print texture; dynamic Dutch angle composition; 1980s city-pop album cover vibe. Consistent style, perfect visual coherence, EDM, Stories-style animation, handheld camera, musical feel, tech-house, party, bouncing, shaky camera, dynamic motion, wind-blown effect, foreshortening, hand dancing, non-verbal, camera swaying left and right, unstable camera, fisheye lens moving rhythmically up/down and forward/backward, DJing, mostly dance moves, shimmy (shoulder shaking), hands raised upward, camera tracking and rotating, fisheye lens, fluid and elegant flowing motion, fingers sliding along body lines with the camera following the hand, momentary gestures facing the audience, flickering/jittery line art, flickering/jittery stippled shading, flickering/jittery art medium, flickering/jittery paint stroke textures, traditional painting medium, semi-sketch style.","imgs":["https://cms-assets.youmind.com/media/1785573822845_6n5iwv_HOjIQVjbcAACqPM.jpg"]},{"i":6336,"text":"# Reference and Purpose\n- Attach one {argument name=\"reference\" default=\"full-body female reference image\"} owned by the user.\n- Apply the reference image only to the {argument name=\"subject\" default=\"Princess\"}, not to the General.\n- Create one 1:1 square character sheet suitable for sharing and video production reference.\n- Balance visual appeal with practical utility for identifying persons, outfits, and weapons.\n- No storyboards; no depictions of background such as castle or throne.\n\n# Inheritance of Reference Subject\nInherit the Princess's facial features, eyes, face shape, nose/mouth, hairstyle, color, bangs, parting, length, age, skin, height, proportions, and body type from the reference image. Maintain identity across all views without excessive beautification or aging. Do not inherit outfit, color scheme, or background from the reference.\n\n# Expression\n- Delicate lines equivalent to theatrical anime, high-quality cel shading, and refined texture for metal, cloth, and gems.\n- Sophisticated finish equivalent to an official artbook.\n- Avoid 3D, realistic, or cheap TV anime styles.\n\n# Fixed Character Design\n## Princess\n- Slender and elegant royal fencer.\n- Pearl-white high-grade combat attire, avoiding excessive exposure.\n- Chrome silver shoulder/arm/waist armor. Do not cover the entire chest in metal.\n- Royal crimson short divided tabard and long sash.\n- Pearl-white knee-high boots with crimson/chrome accents.\n- Champagne gold trim, royal crest motifs, small emeralds, and a thin circlet.\n\n## Royal Sword\nSlender silver straight sword with a curved gold guard, dark green grip, crown pommel, and dark brown scabbard.\n\n## General\n- Mature male, taller and broader than the Princess, stern angular face, short black hair with grey.\n- Heavy armor made of blackened steel and high-quality gunmetal.\n- Multi-layered breastplate, broad pauldrons, high collar, gold inlay, lion/raptor reliefs.\n- Black velvet cloak with dark green lining, dark brown leather belt.\n\n# Layout\n1:1 square. Top 6% title, upper section 56%, lower section 38%.\nBackground is white to light ivory. Titles: `{argument name=\"title\" default=\"SWORD PRINCESS\"}` and `CHARACTER REFERENCE` only.\n\n## Upper Section\n- `01 PRINCESS HERO` (45%): Full-body 3/4 view in battle-ready pose.\n- `02 PRINCESS FRONT` (22%): Full-body front view.\n- `03 GENERAL COMBAT` (33%): Full-body 3/4 view of the General.\n\n## Lower Section\n- `04 PRINCESS FACE` (32%): Two facial views (front and 3/4).\n- `05 GENERAL FACE` (16%): One facial view of the General.\n- `07 ASSET GUIDE` (24%): Weapons and color palette.\n- `06 GENERAL SURRENDER` (28%): General kneeling on one knee.","imgs":["https://cms-assets.youmind.com/media/1785573849746_vai4jo_HOnEvQhaoAACFFh.jpg"]},{"i":6337,"text":"Character asset setting board for a short drama themed on the Chinese classic \"Dream of the Red Chamber,\" featuring the character Lin Daiyu. It uses a fictional classical family art style, not replicating any existing film or TV versions. An adult Chinese actress presents the delicate youth of a teenage girl, with a thin oval face, \"frown-like\" eyebrows, and clear, emotional eyes with slightly red corners, a slender nose, pale lips, and a pale but naturally flushed complexion. Long black hair is styled in a light low bun. Her figure is slender with slightly pulled-in shoulders, a posture like a willow swaying in the wind, intelligent and sensitive rather than sickly. Pure white seamless background, 16:9 cinematic character asset board. A fixed identity info card in the top left accurately displays the name \"Lin Daiyu\" and the bio: \"An orphaned girl living in the Rong Mansion, guarding sensitive true feelings with a poetic heart.\" The name is in bold black simplified Chinese, and the bio is in smaller dark gray text, left-aligned in up to two lines, with no typos or garbled characters. The largest module shows a full-body main view of her wearing a smoky-blue cross-collar long robe, moon-white pleated skirt, light lotus-root colored silk stole, and plain embroidered shoes, holding a silk pouch for fallen flowers. It displays the same main look from full-body front, left and right sides, back, and three-quarter perspectives, locking the face, eyes, body type, bun, stole, skirt length, and shoe type. It includes front, side, and three-quarter facial close-ups, plus five expressions: cautious upon first entering the mansion, a slight smile when understanding Baoyu, sarcastic, mourning flowers, and clear focus while writing poetry. Costume assets show the simple travel outfit, daily look at Xiaoxiang Pavilion, and the gathering look at the Begonia Poetry Society, showing structure, layers, footwear, weaving patterns, and wear. Makeup and hair assets show light pale foundation, red eye corners, light bean-paste lips, the structure of the low bun, and a few flower ornaments. Items like the silk pouch, poem manuscripts, old handkerchief, brush, medicine bottle, and bamboo-leaf sachet are displayed independently, with color swatches of smoky blue, moon white, lotus root, bamboo green, and ink gray, along with samples of silk, satin, Xuan paper, and white porcelain. Realistic Chinese actor classical cinematic photography, only one character, no Baoyu, maids, gardens, or flower-burying scenes, no replication of existing actors, no exaggerated tear makeup, social media faces, studio hanfu, sexy poses, watermarks, or redundant text. The character's appearance and situation are based on the description of Daiyu in Chapter 3 of \"Dream of the Red Chamber.\"","imgs":["https://cms-assets.youmind.com/media/1785573857094_le1at1_HOmrFB0aUAAir4r.jpg"]},{"i":6338,"text":"Create a cinematic photorealistic wide shot of {argument name=\"character name\" default=\"a Japanese high school girl\"} standing on the left side of a wet seaside road at blue hour after rain. She is full-body, facing slightly toward the camera with a gentle smile, long straight black hair with bangs, wearing a navy school blazer, white shirt, red ribbon tie, blue plaid pleated skirt, navy knee-high socks, and black loafers. The setting is a quiet coastal road curving to the right, with the ocean on the left behind a metal guardrail, a large dark rocky sea stack near the horizon, and exactly 2 lit streetlamps casting warm orange reflections across the rain-slick asphalt. Add distant utility poles, a small dark roadside shelter on the far right, low greenery along the roadside, deep blue cloudy dusk sky, and calm moody atmosphere. Use realistic Japanese live-action drama photography, 16:9 horizontal composition, shallow but natural depth of field, soft cinematic lighting, wet pavement reflections, cool blue color grade contrasted with warm lamp glow, no text, no watermark, no extra people or vehicles.","imgs":["https://cms-assets.youmind.com/media/1785573879920_cag3xb_HOmjosWbcAAImuU.jpg"]},{"i":6339,"text":"Subject: Cool Summer Time on the Porch\n\nMain Subject: A woman in her 20s sitting on a bright summer engawa porch, smiling while holding a transparent Ramune bottle next to her face. She is surrounded by several small chibi-style characters with the same hairstyle and outfit, each performing different actions like holding a fan, pointing, drawing, or hugging. A glass wind chime hangs on the top left, and a goldfish bowl with a round floral fan sits on the bottom right.\n\nCharacter/Expression: Faces slightly left while looking at the camera with a gentle, friendly smile. Soft oval face, almond-shaped light brown eyes, and natural thin brows. Her brown long hair is in a high half-up style with thin bangs and small {argument name=\"hair ornament\" default=\"light blue flower decorations\"}.\n\nClothing/Pose: A sleeveless knit top in {argument name=\"top color\" default=\"light blue\"} with a V-neck and lace-style patterns, paired with a white long flared skirt. She holds the bottle with her right hand and supports herself with her left hand on the floor.\n\nBackground/Light: A {argument name=\"background\" default=\"traditional wooden house porch\"} with open shoji doors and a vibrant green garden. Soft natural light from the top left creates warm dapples on the skin, hair, and floor.\n\nComposition/Camera: Vertical 3:4 aspect ratio. Knee-up to full-body portrait with the person centered. Chibi characters are scattered rhythmically around her. Shallow depth of field.\n\nTexture/Style: High-definition photorealistic expression for the main person and porch. Small characters are rendered as refined 3D chibi models. Hand-drawn line art in white, pink, and yellow is overlaid with doodles like hearts, suns, and text like \"SUMMER\" and \"HAPPY\".\n\nNegative: Do not mix faces of main subject and chibis; keep hand/bottle grip natural; do not omit wind chime or goldfish bowl.","imgs":["https://cms-assets.youmind.com/media/1785573858673_p2txde_HOmcyKja0AA_esY.jpg"]},{"i":6340,"text":"A {argument name=\"hair color\" default=\"silver-haired\"} {argument name=\"profession\" default=\"female warrior\"} standing in a {argument name=\"location\" default=\"misty forest\"}, with pale moonlight illuminating her armor and fairy lights dancing at the tip of her staff.","imgs":["https://cms-assets.youmind.com/media/1785573861344_h6ly3o_HOmLUyoXsAAgGaY.jpg"]},{"i":6341,"text":"Core Intent:\nCapture natural interactions between an adult woman and various arcade machines as a series of authentic MiniDV home video frames from around the millennium. \n\nCommon Settings:\n{argument name=\"video texture\" default=\"Vertical portrait, clearly adult original female, authentic arcade environment. MiniDV home video quality, slight interlaced scan lines, color bleeding, dark noise, motion blur, and a timestamp/recording feel.\"} Characters preserve natural skin texture and slight asymmetries, avoiding excessive skin smoothing or commercial model posing. Arcade lights serve as ambient lighting, with soft top-mounted fill light illuminating the face; random light spots covering facial features are prohibited.\n\nFrame 1:\nNarrow claw machine aisle after closing. Slight high-angle shot from the top left; the woman has just finished restocking and is closing the glass door with one hand, body forming a diagonal line along the machine as she looks back at the camera. Shiny pink-white service uniform with an opaque low collar, cinched waist skirt, and stockings. Contrast between cool white cabinet light and dark hallway shadows.\n\nFrame 2:\nOld-school dance machine platform. Side-tracking shot from waist height; the woman has just finished the last beat, feet landed stably on two pedals, body still in slight motion with ponytail and skirt retaining inertia. Silver-blue stage uniform, with blue-purple reflections from the arcade screen and pedal lights; blur only appears on hair tips and background.\n\nFrame 3:\nRed and black racing simulator cockpit. Low-angle close-up from the side-front of the dashboard; the woman leans back naturally into the bucket seat after the race, shoulders relaxed, turning to look at the camera. Red and black racing-style uniform, with clear wheel, gauge, and seat structures; accurate physical interaction between body and equipment without clipping.\n\nFrame 4:\nInside a pink photo booth. Camera near the outer curtain; the woman peeks her upper body out from between two pink plastic curtains, as if checking for friends after a photo. Black and white lace uniform, hands hidden behind curtains, focus on eyes, slightly parted lips, and close-range flash lighting.\n\nNegative:\n{argument name=\"negative prompt\" default=\"Underage feel, doll-like face, excessive skin smoothing, plastic skin, random facial light spots, perfect commercial ad, modern HD cinema look, floating characters, clipping between equipment and body, deformed steering wheels, incorrect pedal placement, unnaturally enlarged foreground limbs, extra fingers, duplicated limbs, garbled text, real brand logos, watermarks.\"}","imgs":["https://cms-assets.youmind.com/media/1785573843558_qoy78s_HOjujutboAAGW6f.jpg"]},{"i":6342,"text":"a movie poster layout for \"{argument name=\"title\" default=\"TITLE\"}\" with an expansive white background acting as negative space, featuring reference image. high-quality 2D anime illustration medium, cel-shaded with soft 3D-like rendering, using a stark white baseline palette contrasted with the colors of the reference image. Korean manhwa. note: it requires at least 1 image as reference. note 2: add this in the prompt to remove the poster credits: negative: billing block or credit block","imgs":["https://cms-assets.youmind.com/media/1785573823901_olcn1h_HOjUQvuX0AAtCdW.jpg"]},{"i":6343,"text":"“Create a premium cinematic character bible sheet for a casino gambler named ACE. Use the uploaded character sheet as the strict visual reference for his exact face, body, proportions, hair, skin tone and outfit. Do not change his appearance.\n\nLEFT SIDE:","imgs":["https://cms-assets.youmind.com/media/1785573868877_6ewk3z_HOjVLaIXMAAL8RS.jpg"]},{"i":6344,"text":"A cinematic, highly detailed scene of a {argument name=\"subject\" default=\"27-year-old man with a smart, lean physique, soft brown hair, and a shy, innocent expression\"}. He is dressed in simple corporate office attire, reflecting the routine of a monotonous 9-to-5 office life. He stands quietly at a {argument name=\"location\" default=\"crowded city bus stop\"} during the evening rush hour, surrounded by dozens of commuters who seem distant and emotionless. The entire world is shown in black and white, emphasizing the dullness and repetition of his daily life. Dark clouds gather overhead, and rain suddenly begins to pour. While everyone around him rushes to open umbrellas or seek shelter, he simply lowers his gaze, accepting the rain in silence. At that moment, a {argument name=\"stranger\" default=\"25-year-old woman with fair skin, an elegant appearance, and a warm, genuine smile\"} steps beside him. She gently extends her umbrella to cover both of them. As he looks up and their eyes meet, they exchange a quiet, heartfelt smile. The instant their eyes meet, the black-and-white world begins transforming into vibrant color. The rain glows softly, the city lights become warm and vivid, and every detail around them comes to life. The crowd remains in the background, blurred and insignificant, while the two stand beneath the umbrella, sharing a silent, magical connection. The scene is emotional, romantic, and hopeful, symbolizing how a single act of kindness can bring color into someone’s life.","imgs":["https://cms-assets.youmind.com/media/1785573820474_lx4rpl_HOiy_6mbYAAngft.jpg"]},{"i":6345,"text":"Create two separate high-end fashion editorial photos of the same character: a fair-skinned young woman with natural freckles, expressive brown eyes, and a short {argument name=\"hair color\" default=\"purple\"} bob haircut with soft bangs.\n\nShe wears a white crew-neck T-shirt with green {argument name=\"shirt text\" default=\"“CÉLFISH”\"} text, an open reddish-pink blazer with rolled sleeves, flowing pastel blush-pink wide-leg pleated trousers, and clean white sneakers. Both images are set outdoors in a dry grassy field with rocky hills, sparse trees, and a clear blue sky, with a large vertical pastel-pink backdrop panel centered behind her.\n\nImage 1: wider full-body composition, confident stance with feet slightly spread and both hands in the trouser pockets, looking slightly to the side.\n\nImage 2: cleaner centered full-body fashion portrait, upright relaxed posture, hands in pockets, subtle sideward gaze.\n\nBright direct sunlight, crisp natural shadows, vivid colors, photorealistic skin and hair, detailed clothing texture, surreal outdoor-studio fashion aesthetic, premium magazine photography, ultra-realistic, 8K.","imgs":["https://cms-assets.youmind.com/media/1786090903265_bi2n7i_HPGBj-GaYAE44L0.jpg"]},{"i":6346,"text":"{\n  \"identity\": {\n    \"reference\": \"Use the uploaded face photo as the STRICT identity reference.\",\n    \"priority\": \"ABSOLUTE\",\n    \"preserve\": [\n      \"exact facial identity\",\n      \"facial proportions\",\n      \"eyes\",\n      \"eyebrows\",\n      \"nose\",\n      \"lips\",\n      \"jawline\",\n      \"ears\",\n      \"skin tone\",\n      \"hairline\",\n      \"hairstyle\",\n      \"recognizable appearance\"\n    ],\n    \"gender\": \"Automatically adapt naturally for male or female.\"\n  },\n\n  \"image\": {\n    \"title\": \"Metropolitan Identity\",\n    \"aspect_ratio\": \"4:5\",\n    \"style\": [\n      \"Ultra Photorealistic\",\n      \"Luxury Editorial\",\n      \"Swiss Graphic Design\",\n      \"Double Exposure\",\n      \"Fine Art Portrait\",\n      \"Minimal Poster Design\"\n    ],\n    \"composition\": {\n      \"shot\": \"Waist-up portrait.\",\n      \"camera_angle\": \"Three-quarter profile.\",\n      \"background\": \"Clean light gray studio backdrop.\",\n      \"framing\": \"Centered minimalist editorial composition.\"\n    },\n    \"subject\": {\n      \"expression\": {\n        \"emotion\": \"Calm, elegant, confident.\",\n        \"eyes\": \"Looking slightly downward into the distance.\",\n        \"overall\": \"Professional luxury fashion model.\"\n      },\n      \"hair\": {\n        \"style\": \"Natural premium editorial styling.\"\n      },\n      \"wardrobe\": {\n        \"description\": \"Minimal tailored blazer matching the accent color.\"\n      }\n    },\n    \"double_exposure\": {\n      \"city\": \"{argument name=\"city\" default=\"New York\"}\",\n      \"placement\": \"Modern skyscrapers are visible only inside the silhouette of the subject's clothing and lower body. The face remains clean and fully recognizable.\",\n      \"blend\": \"Soft realistic double exposure with architectural transparency.\"\n    },\n    \"graphic_design\": {\n      \"style\": \"Modern Swiss typography layout\",\n      \"accent_color\": \"{argument name=\"accent color\" default=\"Electric Blue\"}\",\n      \"elements\": [\n        \"large translucent horizontal rectangle crossing the eyes\",\n        \"minimal geometric blocks\",\n        \"clean vertical typography\",\n        \"subtle transparent overlays\"\n      ],\n      \"text\": \"{argument name=\"city name\" default=\"NYC\"}\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"lighting\": {\n    \"style\": \"Soft studio beauty lighting.\",\n    \"contrast\": \"Medium.\",\n    \"quality\": \"Luxury editorial.\"\n  },\n  \"camera\": {\n    \"body\": \"Phase One XF\",\n    \"lens\": \"80mm\",\n    \"aperture\": \"f/5.6\"\n  },\n  \"color\": {\n    \"base\": \"Monochrome black and white.\",\n    \"accent\": \"<ACCENT COLOR ONLY>\",\n    \"rule\": \"Only the graphic elements, eye bar, typography accents, jacket highlights and selected design overlays use the accent color.\"\n  },\n  \"quality\": [\n    \"Ultra Photorealistic\",\n    \"Luxury Magazine Cover\",\n    \"Fine Art\",\n    \"HDR\",\n    \"8K\",\n    \"Extreme Detail\"\n  ]\n}","imgs":["https://cms-assets.youmind.com/media/1786090905520_uprdzh_HPF2PmFawAAt-xT.jpg"]},{"i":6347,"text":"Editorial flat-vector portrait of {argument name=\"character\" default=\"a fashion model\"} in a tight bust crop and three-quarter view, with the head tilted slightly downward, wearing {argument name=\"eyewear\" default=\"oversized sunglasses\"} and {argument name=\"accessory\" default=\"sculptural jewelry\"}. Style the hair as [HAIRCUT] and dress the subject in [CLOTHING] with a high sculptural collar. Render the face, hair, clothing, and accessories as clean interlocking color shapes with sharp geometric edges, hard-edged shadows, minimal linework, and no gradients. Limit the artwork to [COLORS]. Place the figure against [BACKGROUND], using one simple rectangular shadow shape to frame the head without clutter. Keep the expression calm and self-assured, the silhouette bold, and the composition sleek, fashion-forward, and graphic; Vertical 4:5 aspect ratio.","imgs":["https://cms-assets.youmind.com/media/1786090897749_ozviid_HPFu0GuaYAEP9SY.jpg"]},{"i":6348,"text":"A {argument name=\"ratio\" default=\"3:4\"} vertical brand key visual for a new product launch poster, designed as the main visual for new product communication. The subject is a {argument name=\"subject\" default=\"durian gift box\"} in the fresh fruit category, with an overall tone of strong tropical luxury. The composition uses a vertical centered focus, with the subject enlarged in the middle and a restrained sense of space surrounding it. The background is a high-end tropical fruit gift setting, incorporating soft-material platforms to establish spatial layers for the brand. The focus is on the spiked shell structure and the dense texture of the fruit pulp, using dramatic unidirectional spotlights and controlled reflections to establish the subject's silhouette, material reflection, and brand mood. The color system uses {argument name=\"color scheme\" default=\"Golden Durian Yellow #C9A347 + Milk White #F4EEDF + Dark Brown-Green #5B5847\"}. The typography system includes title + subtitle + logo area, with the text safety zone placed at the top title area to ensure clear margins for the title, slogan, and logo. The overall result should be a genuine, deployable brand key visual, rather than a typical e-commerce main image or detail page collage, avoiding excessive parameter stickers.","imgs":["https://cms-assets.youmind.com/media/1786090918988_jms167_HPFrIe7b0AAeCMs.jpg"]},{"i":6349,"text":"Goal: Create a glamorous vertical fashion magazine cover featuring a young woman as the central cover model, styled like a high-end beauty and lifestyle editorial.\n\nCanvas: Tall portrait magazine cover, 2:3 aspect ratio, full-bleed photographic cover, premium glossy print look. Dark warm bokeh background with soft golden lights, shallow depth of field, cinematic evening lighting.\n\nSubject details: A young East Asian woman with {argument name=\"hair style\" default=\"dark brown hair in a loose updo with wispy bangs and face-framing strands\"}, natural luminous makeup, glossy lips, delicate drop earrings, and a poised over-the-shoulder pose. She looks directly at the viewer with a calm confident expression. Her shoulders and upper back are visible. She wears a sparkling blush-pink tulle couture dress with a strapless bodice, glitter texture, sheer layered ruffles, and a delicate bracelet. Skin should look polished and editorial but realistic.\n\nMagazine identity and typography: Large masthead at the very top reading {argument name=\"magazine title\" default=\"EMA'S\"} in huge elegant high-contrast serif letters, pale pink color, spanning nearly the full width. Beneath the masthead on the left, small uppercase text: “FASHION | BEAUTY | LIFESTYLE”. On the upper right, small uppercase issue text: {argument name=\"issue text\" default=\"AUGUST 2025\\nISSUE 48\"}. Use a refined fashion magazine typography mix: tall serif headlines, italic serif accents, clean sans-serif body copy, and a large handwritten script feature line.\n\nLayout and text content: Include exactly 8 cover text groups plus 1 barcode block:\n1. Top masthead: “EMA'S”.\n2. Small category line: “FASHION | BEAUTY | LIFESTYLE”.\n3. Issue information: “AUGUST 2025” and “ISSUE 48”.\n4. Left upper feature: headline “NEW\\nSEASON\\nGLOW” with body copy “Effortless beauty\\nlooks to carry\\nyou through\\nevery moment.” and a short thin divider line.\n5. Left middle feature: italic headline “Mind.\\nBody.\\nBalance.” with body copy “Wellness rituals\\nfor a calmer,\\nstronger you.” and a short thin divider line.\n6. Right upper feature: italic headline “Be\\nYou” with body copy “Confidence\\nis the best\\naccessory.” and a short thin divider line.\n7. Right middle circular badge: thin pale-pink outlined circle containing “EXCLUSIVE\\nINTERVIEW” and smaller text “Inspiring\\nconversations.\\nReal stories.”\n8. Right lower feature: headline “FASHION\\nFORECAST” with body copy “Key trends,\\nfresh staples,\\ntimeless style.” and a short thin divider line.\n9. Bottom main cover line: huge white handwritten script reading {argument name=\"main cover line\" default=\"Made to Shine\"}, overlapping the lower dress area, with small uppercase tagline underneath: {argument name=\"tagline\" default=\"EMBRACE YOUR STORY. OWN YOUR POWER.\"}\n10. Bottom-left barcode block: small white barcode rectangle with black bars, tiny price text above such as “$6.99 US   $8.99 CAN”, and small numeric details.\n\nVisual style: Photorealistic fashion editorial cover, warm contrast, soft rim light on hair and shoulders, elegant pink-and-white typography, luxury beauty magazine aesthetic, clean professional spacing. Keep the model centered slightly right, face in the upper-middle, masthead behind/above her head, and the large script title across the bottom.\n\nConstraints: No extra logos or watermarks. Make all text crisp and legible. Preserve the exact count and placement of the listed text groups. Do not add additional headlines beyond the specified cover lines.","imgs":["https://cms-assets.youmind.com/media/1786090977950_22rotw_HPB9JHBaoAA3m_1.jpg"]},{"i":6350,"text":"Create an ultra-realistic cinematic luxury winter travel photograph in portrait (9:16).\n\nScene: A beautiful handcrafted log cabin sits deep within a snow-covered alpine forest after a fresh overnight snowfall. Soft snow blankets the rooftop, wooden fences, pine trees, and surrounding landscape. Warm golden light glows through the cabin windows while gentle smoke rises naturally from the stone chimney into the crisp winter sky.\n\nOn the spacious wooden porch, a stylish female traveler relaxes in a rustic rocking chair wrapped in a chunky cream knit blanket. She wears a cozy oversized cable-knit sweater, wool socks, and soft winter loungewear while holding a steaming mug of rich hot chocolate with both hands. Her expression is peaceful as she watches the quiet snowy landscape.\n\nAround her is a beautifully styled hygge setting: a wooden coffee table with homemade cookies, cinnamon rolls, marshmallows, pinecones, flickering lanterns, glowing candles, fresh evergreen branches, a vintage film camera, a leather journal, and a stack of classic books. A soft sheepskin rug, knitted pillows, and woven blankets add warmth and texture.\n\nBeyond the porch, towering snow-covered pine trees surround the cabin, with majestic snow-capped mountains glowing under the first rays of sunrise. Gentle snowflakes drift through the air while untouched footprints disappear into the fresh powder. The atmosphere feels calm, magical, and completely secluded.\n\nLuxury mountain lodge aesthetic inspired by Aman Resorts and Four Seasons, Scandinavian hygge style, cinematic golden sunrise lighting, volumetric sun rays, soft snowfall, realistic chimney smoke, warm window glow, ultra-detailed wood textures, HDR, 8K, National Geographic quality, Vogue Living editorial photography, shallow depth of field, natural skin tones, warm cinematic color grading, peaceful atmosphere, masterpiece composition, scroll-stopping winter escape, no text, no watermark, no crowds, no vehicles, no distractions.","imgs":["https://cms-assets.youmind.com/media/1786090943404_wplztg_HPFL3C7bIAA2vJ1.jpg"]},{"i":6351,"text":"Create a bold, colorful 1:1 social media campaign grid for \"{argument name=\"product name\" default=\"PRODUCT NAME\"}\" using the uploaded reference image, or generate a premium, ultra-realistic version of {argument name=\"product name\" default=\"PRODUCT NAME\"}. Automatically adapt all colors, ingredients, textures, props, decorative elements, and the overall visual mood according to the product type or uploaded reference. Design a modern pop-art inspired promotional collage featuring multiple creative square sections.\n\nCanvas Size:\n1:1 Square Format — 1080 × 1080 px, optimized for Instagram posts and trendy social media branding.\n\nSetting & Background:\nUse vibrant pop-art backgrounds with energetic color blocking, abstract wave patterns, maze lines, retro squiggles, doodle outlines, neon accents, playful geometric shapes, and modern Memphis-style design elements. Divide the composition into four creative grid sections, each with a unique background style and dynamic visual rhythm.\n\nLighting:\nBright commercial studio lighting with glossy highlights, vibrant color reflections, soft realistic shadows, premium texture enhancement, and a playful modern advertising atmosphere.\n\nStyle:\nModern pop-art advertising aesthetic, Gen Z branding style, trendy Instagram campaign visuals, colorful street-style graphics, a minimal yet energetic layout, bold modern typography, premium commercial poster design, and ultra-realistic product rendering.\n\nTypography Style:\nUse oversized bold typography with playful layout placement.\nMix condensed modern fonts with handwritten accent text.\nKeep typography energetic, youthful, and visually dynamic.\n\nColor Direction:\nAutomatically adapt the color palette to the product:\n\nIce Cream → Pink, Cyan, Orange, Yellow\n\nSneakers → Neon Green, Purple, Black\n\nCosmetics → Pastel Pink, Lavender, Cream\n\nTech Products → Electric Blue, Black, Lime\n\nUse high-contrast, trend-driven colors with strong visual impact.\n\nCamera:\nCentered hero product composition, close-up commercial photography, slightly tilted dynamic framing, shallow depth of field, ultra-sharp focus, cinematic advertising quality, and 4K modern campaign rendering.\n\nText Elements:\nInclude stylish promotional texts such as:\n\n\"New Collection\"\n\"Limited Edition\"\n\"Now Available\"\n\"Fresh Drop\"\n\"Premium Quality\"\n\"Trending Now\"\n\nImportant:\n\n• Keep the design divided into creative square sections.\n• Automatically adapt colors, graphics, and decorative elements to {argument name=\"product name\" default=\"PRODUCT NAME\"}.\n• Maintain a playful pop-art branding style throughout.\n• Use vibrant, modern color combinations.\n• Keep typography large, bold, and visually engaging.\n• Avoid empty spaces and dull tones.\n• Ensure the final design looks like a trendy, premium Instagram campaign.","imgs":["https://cms-assets.youmind.com/media/1786090944981_tvm824_HPDxIdJacAALUUK.jpg"]},{"i":6352,"text":"An ultra-realistic close-up portrait of an elegant young woman enjoying a sunny afternoon aboard a luxury yacht cruising across a pristine tropical lagoon. She is captured from a three-quarter rear angle, her body turned away from the camera as she glances back with a relaxed, radiant smile. She has flawless fair skin, a softly sculpted oval face, expressive dark eyebrows, delicate facial features, naturally rosy lips, and luminous skin. Her long chestnut-brown wavy hair flows freely in the ocean breeze. She is dressed in a sleek black sleeveless top, accessorized with vintage-inspired oval sunglasses featuring a slim gold frame and a minimalist rose-gold wristwatch. Behind her, sparkling turquoise water stretches to the horizon beneath a vivid blue sky filled with towering white clouds, creating an idyllic luxury travel atmosphere. Warm natural sunlight enhances the rich ocean colors and subtle skin tones. Shallow depth of field, premium travel editorial style, lifelike skin detail, crisp hair strands, HDR photography, cinematic realism, flagship smartphone camera quality, ultra-detailed 8K.","imgs":["https://cms-assets.youmind.com/media/1786090942940_95ze4r_HPDcnp2bIAE_hXt.jpg"]},{"i":6353,"text":"Ultra-realistic full-body fashion portrait of an elegant young woman standing in a lush royal courtyard during a bright spring afternoon. She has long chestnut-brown hair styled into {argument name=\"hair style\" default=\"twin buns adorned with delicate pearl blossoms\"}, expressive {argument name=\"eye color\" default=\"emerald-green\"} eyes, and a warm, natural smile. She wears an intricately designed {argument name=\"dress color\" default=\"sapphire-blue and ivory\"} Victorian-inspired dress featuring layered ruffles, embroidered lace, puffed sleeves, a fitted bodice, and a decorative waist ribbon, complemented by a crisp white apron. Her outfit is completed with white over-the-knee stockings accented by satin ribbons and classic white heels. She stands gracefully along a cobblestone garden path surrounded by blooming hydrangeas, roses, and climbing flowers, with an enchanting palace rising in the distance. Soft golden sunlight filters through the trees, creating cinematic highlights and gentle shadows. Ultra-photorealistic skin with natural pores, lifelike facial details, authentic textures, shallow depth of field, premium editorial photography, HDR, captured on an 85mm full-frame camera, breathtaking realism, ultra-high detail, 8K.","imgs":["https://cms-assets.youmind.com/media/1786090893397_xnqopa_HPDPOkxbgAA7d2B.jpg"]},{"i":6354,"text":"Create a vertical, hyperrealistic summer fantasy beverage advertisement scene: an extreme close-up of a tall transparent glass filled with sparkling emerald-green soda, crushed ice, bubbles, condensation droplets, and glossy lime-like highlights, sitting on a bright sandy beach. From the drink rises a miniature icy arctic world: one translucent blue ice whale breaching dramatically from the soda with its head and body arcing upward, water splashes and droplets frozen midair, and fine glowing ice ridges along its body. Beside it, on a rounded white snow-and-ice mound floating at the surface, place exactly four small arctic animals: three penguins standing upright in a row, and one white polar bear standing to their right. The animals should look like delicate frosty ice sculptures with subtle realistic detail. Background: turquoise ocean, blurred beachgoers, distant low mountains, a vivid cloudless blue sky with a soft white cloud on the right, and intense summer sun rays and lens flare from the upper left. Use bright refreshing colors, sparkling highlights, shallow depth of field, macro photography perspective, high contrast between tropical heat and icy coolness, cinematic realism, no text, no logo, no watermark. Customize the drink as {argument name=\"drink color\" default=\"emerald green\"}, the main icy creature as {argument name=\"ice creature\" default=\"breaching blue whale\"}, the arctic animal group as {argument name=\"animal group\" default=\"three penguins and one polar bear\"}, the setting as {argument name=\"beach setting\" default=\"sunny tropical beach\"}, and the lighting mood as {argument name=\"lighting mood\" default=\"brilliant midday sun with lens flare\"}.","imgs":["https://cms-assets.youmind.com/media/1786090970130_2i7m4g_HPC1mpXbMAA8wC-.jpg"]},{"i":6355,"text":"Use the downloaded product image as an exact reference. Fully preserve the shape, packaging, materials, colors, proportions, logo, and brand elements.\nAn ultra-realistic commercial advertising poster. A {argument name=\"view\" default=\"low-angle wide-angle lens view\"}. A confident, stylish model holding the product, directly facing the camera. The product dominates the foreground due to the forced perspective effect.\nA modern fashion image, with clothing, accessories, and color palette automatically adapting to the product's style and colors. Dynamic energy, premium brand aesthetics, trendy lifestyle content.\nA highly detailed product with realistic textures, reflections, water droplets, and perfectly legible packaging. The background is filled with {argument name=\"background elements\" default=\"graphic elements in the brand's colors: graffiti, brush strokes, paint splashes, collage textures, arrows, stars, lightning bolts, stickers, and advertising typography\"}.\nAll text in the image must be written in {argument name=\"language\" default=\"Russian\"}, fully legible, grammatically correct, without spelling errors, random symbols, distorted letters, unreadable words, or AI artifacts. All headlines, slogans, descriptions, flavors, characteristics, and advertising phrases should look like a real professional advertisement.\nThe AI automatically adapts fonts, sizes, composition, and text placement to the poster layout.\nPremium magazine design, high contrast, sharp focus, commercial product photography, luxury advertising, fashion editorial, ultra realistic, photorealistic, HDR, 8K.\nAvoid: unreadable text, errors in Russian, AI artifacts, CGI, cartoonish style, distorted product, blurriness, watermarks, and low quality.","imgs":["https://cms-assets.youmind.com/media/1786090941109_slxfek_HPC3OahXAAAkSdR.jpg"]},{"i":6356,"text":"Use the uploaded model photo as an exact personality reference. Preserve appearance 1:1: face, features, proportions, skin, hair, and overall look. Do not change the personality. The skin must be maximally natural and alive: real pores, natural texture, soft natural glow, no plastic retouching, no beautify, no excessive smoothing. Use the uploaded product photo as an exact product reference. Preserve the product 1:1: shape, size, proportions, packaging, cap, label, logo, text, material, color, coating, reflections, and all design details. The product must look maximally natural and realistic, like a real physical object in hand, not CGI, without distortions and without reinterpretation. Close-up beauty shot in the style of a {argument name=\"campaign style\" default=\"modern luxury cosmetic campaign\"}. The model from the photo reference holds the product from the uploaded photo near one eye, slightly covering it, and makes a {argument name=\"facial expression\" default=\"playful facial expression with soft lips in a kissy face style\"}. Gaze is directed at the camera. Hair is smoothly combed back. On the ears — {argument name=\"accessories\" default=\"gold hoop earrings\"}. Background — clean minimalist white, without extra objects. Lighting is soft studio, clean beauty lighting, with delicate highlights on skin and product. Makeup is natural and fresh: glowing skin, slightly shiny lips, neat eyebrows, softly emphasized eyes, no heavy makeup. Overall aesthetic — fresh skincare / beauty editorial, glossy, expensive, modern, but at the same time natural and realistic. Frame focus — on the model's face, natural skin, and product. Avoid: changing the face, plastic skin, heavy retouching, CGI product look, unreadable logo, extra objects, bad hand anatomy, cartoonishness.","imgs":["https://cms-assets.youmind.com/media/1785228578524_gnnip9_HOK9jgwXkAAn9wS.jpg"]},{"i":6357,"text":"Create a photorealistic luxury skincare product still life on a 4:3 horizontal canvas. Show exactly 3 unlabeled cosmetic containers standing on a clear acrylic block: 1 tall matte milky-white lotion bottle with a rounded-shoulder shape and translucent white flip cap on the left, 1 transparent pale-blue cylindrical bottle filled with clear liquid and a satin silver cap in the center, and 1 pale lavender-pink pump bottle with a white pump dispenser on the right. Arrange them tightly grouped, centered slightly to the right, with the center blue bottle a little shorter than the white bottle and the pump bottle slightly taller than the blue bottle. The acrylic pedestal should be rectangular, glossy, transparent, and covered with visible water droplets along the front face and top surface. Use a cool misty spa atmosphere: frosted glass background with vertical condensation streaks, many tiny water droplets, soft blue-gray and white gradient lighting, and low lavender-tinted fog drifting around the base. Lighting should be high-key, diffused, backlit through the wet glass, with soft reflections and gentle bloom. No readable labels, no branding, no people, no text, no extra products. Emphasize clean hydration, freshness, dewy condensation, and premium cosmetic advertising photography.","imgs":["https://cms-assets.youmind.com/media/1785055090773_de0cpu_HOET51JaUAEUXFg.jpg"]},{"i":6358,"text":"Create a realistic vertical smartphone mirror selfie of an adult fantasy elf cosplayer sitting on a soft white sheet on a gray carpet in a minimal beige room. The subject is {argument name=\"character name\" default=\"an elf princess cosplayer\"}, wearing a delicate white draped fantasy outfit with gold chain details, thin arm jewelry, gold leg bands, and pale blue flower accessories. She has {argument name=\"hair color\" default=\"long silver-gray\"} hair styled in twin ponytails, pointed elf ears, and a blue-and-white floral crown. Pose her seated with one knee bent close to the body and the other leg extended toward the mirror, creating strong foreground perspective with the bare sole and toes large in the lower left foreground; the other foot is visible near the bottom edge. She holds a light gray smartphone in front of her face, obscuring facial features, with her other hand touching her hair near the ear. Use soft natural window light, muted neutral tones, shallow casual indoor realism, visible mirror edge at the far left, baseboard along the back wall, and a slightly candid cosplay photography aesthetic. Keep the composition intimate but non-explicit, with realistic skin texture, fabric folds, carpet detail, and no added text or watermark.","imgs":["https://cms-assets.youmind.com/media/1785573895035_w4nhjy_HOntKRDaIAA-y8E.jpg"]},{"i":6359,"text":"A refined watercolor-style portrait of {argument name=\"subject\" default=\"a confident, mature man with short salt-and-pepper hair, well groomed beard\"}, and {argument name=\"accessories\" default=\"black rectangular eyeglasses\"}. He is dressed in a charcoal blazer over a black button-up shirt, looking thoughtfully into the distance with a calm, professional expression. The artwork features realistic facial details blended with elegant watercolor splashes in warm beige, gray, and sepia tones on a clean off-white background, creating a sophisticated, modern editorial aesthetic. Use uploaded reference images for facial features and expression alignment and spactacles if. Aspect ratio 10:21.","imgs":["https://cms-assets.youmind.com/media/1785573821595_krp1mu_HOno4GebMAAJaOr.jpg"]}];